T(n,k)=Number of (n+1)X(k+1) arrays of permutations of 0..(n+1)*(k+1)-1 with each element having index change +-(.,.) 0,0 1,2 or 2,2.

The 48 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A264017

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
